    "Reason : 1 - The proposed, rear outrigger roof extension, would unbalance the pair of neighbouring properties, be out of scale and character with this and neighbouring dwellings, as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality and the Chiswick House Conservation area. Thus, it is contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2, CC4 of Local Plan, policies of London Plan (D4 and HC1) and the National Planning Policy Framework."
